  <p class="eyebrow">Independent software studio</p>
  <h1 class="h-display max-w-[900px]">
    Small studio.<br /><span class="text-link">Serious software.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="lead max-w-[640px]">
    Blue Wave Horizon designs, builds and runs mobile apps, web platforms and desktop software. Our
    own products, and yours.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-2 sm:flex-row">
    <Button href="/contact">Start a project</Button>
    <a href="#work" class="text-link-arrow">See our work &rarr;</a>
